sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant E as Cloudflare/ALB
  participant G as realtime-gateway
  participant H as Match host
  participant V as Valkey
  participant DB as MongoDB/R2
  C->>E: WebSocket handshake
  E->>G: Authenticated connection
  G->>V: Route and presence lease
  C->>G: Sequenced signed input
  G->>H: Validated input
  H->>H: Fixed 20 Hz authoritative tick
  H-->>C: 10 Hz snapshot or immediate critical event
  H->>DB: Periodic checkpoint and final history
